# Toast Notification — High Level Design

## HLD Diagram

![Toast Notification HLD](./hld.svg)

## Architecture Flow

User Clicks Button → Toast.jsx → useNotification Hook → Notification Component → Toast UI

 User clicks a button
- Toast.jsx triggers notification
- useNotification manages state
- Notification component renders the UI

## Components

- User
- Toast.jsx
- useNotification Hook
- Notification Component
- Toast UI













